  partName: Central Blade
  description: The Central Blade is a tiny, elongated component situated at the middle-center-center
    of the engine, made from Blades texture material. As a critical component of
    the engine's turbine section, it plays a central role in extracting energy from
    the exhaust gases, converting it into mechanical energy. Interestingly, its central
    location allows it to take advantage of the engine's highest-energy airflow,
    maximizing its energy extraction efficiency.
